Markdown HTML XLIFF Headings <code>#</code> to <code>######</code> <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>–<code>&lt;h6&gt;</code> <code>&lt;unit fs:fs="hN"&gt;</code> Paragraphs <code>&lt;p&gt;</code> One unit per paragraph, one segment per sentence Block quotes <code>&gt;</code> <code>&lt;blockquote&gt;</code> with <code>&lt;p&gt;</code> <code>&lt;group fs:fs="blockquote"&gt;</code> around paragraph units Lists <code>-</code>, <code>*</code>, <code>1.</code> <code>&lt;ul&gt;</code>/<code>&lt;ol&gt;</code> with <code>&lt;li&gt;</code> <code>&lt;group fs:fs="ul"&gt;</code> or <code>"ol"</code> with <code>&lt;unit fs:fs="li"&gt;</code>; <code>start</code> and <code>type</code> kept Definition lists (plugin) <code>&lt;dl&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;dt&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;dd&gt;</code> As HTML definition lists Fenced code <code>&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;</code> <code>&lt;unit fs:fs="pre" xml:space="preserve"&gt;</code>, content verbatim Thematic break <code>---</code>, <code>***</code>, <code>___</code> <code>&lt;hr&gt;</code> <code>&lt;ph&gt;</code> with <code>&lt;originalData&gt;</code> Tables (extension) <code>&lt;table&gt;</code> Preserved unit unless cell-level translation is needed Footnotes (plugin) Footnote section and back links Groups and units mirroring the HTML; links as <code>&lt;mrk&gt;</code> Front matter (plugin) Not rendered Kept verbatim in metadata; not translated <p>Example:</p> <pre><code># Product Overview
Welcome to **Vexy Markliff**.
</code></pre> <pre><code>&lt;unit id="h1" fs:fs="h1"&gt;&lt;segment&gt;&lt;source&gt;Product Overview&lt;/source&gt;&lt;/segment&gt;&lt;/unit&gt;
&lt;unit id="p1" fs:fs="p"&gt;
  &lt;segment&gt;&lt;source&gt;Welcome to &lt;mrk id="m1" fs:fs="strong"&gt;Vexy Markliff&lt;/mrk&gt;.&lt;/source&gt;&lt;/segment&gt;
&lt;/unit&gt;
</code></pre>

Markdown HTML XLIFF <code>*em*</code>, <code>_em_</code>, <code>**strong**</code>, <code>__strong__</code> <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> <code>&lt;mrk fs:fs="em"&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;mrk fs:fs="strong"&gt;</code>; nesting allowed <code>`code`</code> <code>&lt;code&gt;</code> <code>&lt;mrk fs:fs="code"&gt;</code> <code>[text](url "title")</code> <code>&lt;a href title&gt;</code> <code>&lt;mrk fs:fs="a" fs:subFs="href,…"&gt;</code> with the title in <code>fs:subFs</code> <code>![alt](src)</code> <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> <code>&lt;ph&gt;</code> with <code>&lt;originalData&gt;</code>; the <code>alt</code> text stays in the attribute Autolinks, reference links <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> As links; reference definitions stored once in metadata <code>~~strike~~</code> <code>&lt;s&gt;</code> <code>&lt;mrk fs:fs="s"&gt;</code> Task items <code>- [ ]</code> (plugin) <code>&lt;li&gt;</code> with <code>&lt;input type="checkbox"&gt;</code> Checkbox as placeholder; item text as usual Footnote references (plugin) <code>&lt;sup&gt;&lt;a&gt;</code> Nested <code>&lt;mrk&gt;</code> <p>Note</p> <p>The original design note maps strikethrough to <code>&lt;del&gt;</code>. <code>markdown-it-py</code> renders <code>~~text~~</code> as <code>&lt;s&gt;text&lt;/s&gt;</code>, so the marker carries <code>fs:fs="s"</code>.</p> <p>Example:</p> <pre><code>See [docs](https://example.com) and ![logo](logo.svg).
</code></pre> <pre><code>&lt;unit id="p2" fs:fs="p"&gt;
  &lt;originalData&gt;
    &lt;data id="img1"&gt;&amp;lt;img src="logo.svg" alt="logo"/&amp;gt;&lt;/data&gt;
  &lt;/originalData&gt;
  &lt;segment&gt;
    &lt;source&gt;See &lt;mrk id="m1" fs:fs="a" fs:subFs="href,https://example.com"&gt;docs&lt;/mrk&gt;
      and &lt;ph id="ph1" dataRef="img1"/&gt;.&lt;/source&gt;
  &lt;/segment&gt;
&lt;/unit&gt;
</code></pre>
